# Normalise every text file to LF, in the repository and on checkout.
#
# This matters more here than in an ordinary project: check_60_figure.py
# compares the committed SVG against a freshly rendered one, and make_figure.py
# writes LF explicitly. Letting the platform decide line endings would make the
# artifact differ byte for byte between a Windows clone and a Linux one, which
# is exactly the kind of silent platform dependence this package exists to rule
# out.
* text=auto eol=lf
